    "text": "By John Carroll ,\n10 hours ago Bend, Ore. (KTVZ) -- Showers and storms are expected across Southern Oregon today with Thursday being the most active. There is an area of low pressure that will remain in place over Nevada and northern California this week, and that feature will be the driving force behind the rainy and stormy weather. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
